1. STEP_DURATION = .4 comment "AO Libre/Imperium: 1 casillero cada ~0,4 s".
2. Remove NPC_AGGRO_RANGE + SELF_CARE_HP stays.
3. Replace aggro gate block with chase-always/home-return.

Then check + sync + reload + console + tiny probe (movement% should be much higher; also confirm no errors). Then brain files + git.

